o><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≥</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≥</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Then, we apply the multiplication principle, dividing by <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"65\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>−</mo><mn>3.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </p>\n<p>Remember, when multiplying or dividing by a negative number, we need to flip the inequality:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"66\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 5.821em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"></mjx-mi><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: blue;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2265\"></mjx-c